# Generated webview bundles — esbuild rebuilds these from src/webviews/** on
# every build; vscode:prepublish + the CI release job run `npm run compile`
# before packaging, so the committed copy never ships. Tracking them only
# invited dev-watch clobber + huge diffs. Vendored assets stay tracked
# (flatpickr*, webview-common.css).
